@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Registration Confirmed";
}

@*
    RegisterConfirm — success page reached via the Post-Redirect-Get (PRG) pattern.

    The controller redirects here after a successful POST:
        return RedirectToAction(nameof(RegisterConfirm));

    This is a GET request, so the browser can refresh safely without re-submitting
    the form (no duplicate account creation).
*@

<h1>Registration Confirmed</h1>
<p>Your account has been successfully created.</p>
<p><a href="/">Return to home</a></p>
